Maintainer: SeaweedFS Team <team@seaweedfs.com>
Installed-Size: 165102
Depends: adduser
Section: storage
Priority: optional
Description: SeaweedFS Distributed Object Store and File System
 SeaweedFS is a distributed object storage and file system designed for
 large scale data storage. It features:
  - Distributed hash-based file storage
  - S3-compatible API
  - Filer for POSIX-like access
  - Volume server for actual storage
  - Master server for cluster management
 .
 This package provides the SeaweedFS server binaries, systemd service
 templates, and configuration files.
